jpg","C:/Users/VG-it/Downloads/VaultCache/FabLibrary/Simple_Sci-Fi_Futuristic_Distance_Deco_Rooftops-a89bd2c0/fbx/simple-sci-fi-futuristic_extracted/source/model.fbm/T_Rooftops_JFG_emissive.jpg","C:/Users/VG-it/Downloads/VaultCache/FabLibrary/Simple_Sci-Fi_Futuristic_Distance_Deco_Rooftops-a89bd2c0/fbx/simple-sci-fi-futuristic_extracted/source/model.fbm/T_Rooftops_JFG_metallic.jpg","C:/Users/VG-it/Downloads/VaultCache/FabLibrary/Simple_Sci-Fi_Futuristic_Distance_Deco_Rooftops-a89bd2c0/fbx/simple-sci-fi-futuristic_extracted/source/model.fbm/T_Rooftops_JFG_normal.png","C:/Users/VG-it/Downloads/VaultCache/FabLibrary/Simple_Sci-Fi_Futuristic_Distance_Deco_Rooftops-a89bd2c0/fbx/simple-sci-fi-futuristic_extracted/source/model.fbm/T_Rooftops_JFG_NO_LIGHT_baseColor.jpg","C:/Users/VG-it/Downloads/VaultCache/FabLibrary/Simple_Sci-Fi_Futuristic_Distance_Deco_Rooftops-a89bd2c0/fbx/simple-sci-fi-futuristic_extracted/source/model.fbm/T_Rooftops_JFG_NO_LIGHT_metallic.jpg","C:/Users/VG-it/Downloads/VaultCache/FabLibrary/Simple_Sci-Fi_Futuristic_Distance_Deco_Rooftops-a89bd2c0/fbx/simple-sci-fi-futuristic_extracted/source/model.fbm/T_Rooftops_JFG_NO_LIGHT_normal.png","C:/Users/VG-it/Downloads/VaultCache/FabLibrary/Simple_Sci-Fi_Futuristic_Distance_Deco_Rooftops-a89bd2c0/fbx/simple-sci-fi-futuristic_extracted/source/model.fbm/T_Rooftops_JFG_NO_LIGHT_roughness.jpg","C:/Users/VG-it/Downloads/VaultCache/FabLibrary/Simple_Sci-Fi_Futuristic_Distance_Deco_Rooftops-a89bd2c0/fbx/simple-sci-fi-futuristic_extracted/source/model.fbm/T_Rooftops_JFG_roughness.jpg"],"metadata":{"launcher":{"version":"0.0.1","listening_port":24563},"fab":{"assetNamespace":"fab","listing":{"averageRating":4,"createdAt":"","description":"<p>Simple Sci-Fi Futuristic Distance Deco Rooftops Neon Blue Glow + No Light Variations</p>\n<p>Stuff for putting in the background for possible deco and/or prototype stuff.</p>\n<p>I hope it is of use to someone out there, cheers! :]</p>\n<p>How it was made: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://youtu.be/V2KRcx4sXcI?t=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">https://youtu.be/V2KRcx4sXcI?t=5</a></p>\n<p>Practice for getting all UVs into 1 sheet for multiple models. Build time first row/initial row: 1-2 hours. Each row of models share 1 material set for everything. 2K PBR textures. All UVs automatic at angle 45 under 1 sheet, non-overlapping. Tris 4 all around 1700 &amp; 848 Verts. Originally modeled in Quads. Textured in Substance Painter.</p>\n<p>Example of where I used this models in one of my PBR roblox showcases: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.roblox.com/games/10206927667/FUTURISTIC-PLATFORM-VISTA-JFG-PBR-SHOWCASE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">Roblox Showcase</a></p>\n<p><span class=\"lazyload\"></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"lazyload\"></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"lazyload\"></span></p>","isAiForbidden":false,"isAiGenerated":false,"lastUpdatedAt":"","listingType":"3d-model","media":"https://media.fab.com/image_previews/gallery_images/1c66a3f2-08d2-44a4-9c22-65fbb8219f8a/99659e77-0114-4908-b564-9d3145b7d6cc.jpeg","publishedAt":"2024-10-05T06:35:39.013715Z","reviewCount":4,"thumbnail":"https://media.fab.com/image_previews/gallery_images/d18587ce-d448-4447-8bfa-9425e2648c26/80d45352-3fb6-4361-ae59-9deab7016c75.jpeg","title":"Simple Sci-Fi Futuristic Distance Deco Rooftops","uid":"a89bd2c0-97eb-4b08-8438-a52d2b17e102","updatedAt":"","user":{"coverImageUrl":"https://cdn1.epicgames.com/fab/seller/o-rr9hzagn3a22rpeyr2x9tkpf22tznj/cover/cc7cb3b3.jpg","profileImageUrl":"https://cdn1.epicgames.com/fab/seller/o-rr9hzagn3a22rpeyr2x9tkpf22tznj/profileImage/blob-500x500-64ead6592d38582c8b082fccecddfb58.jpg","sellerName":"JamyzGenius","uid":"534f6f73-6692-4cef-b1b5-110a37c9f135"},"tags":[{"name":"Practice","slug":"practice","uid":"0162f4ea-4b85-4f2b-a3b8-1933cc99b134"},{"name":"Future","slug":"future","uid":"1b51f45f-ced8-43e4-ae96-bebb99ac2309"},{"name":"Futuristic","slug":"futuristic","uid":"3ccbe53a-83ee-475a-967a-2468963b77cb"},{"name